# Source of truth

- Prefer repository-governed sources named by the mission packet.
- Preserve source refs and hashes when provided.
- Treat chat, scratch notes, generated summaries, runtime memory, and local caches as supporting context unless explicitly designated otherwise.
- Do not promote a candidate file to canon because it appears newer.
- When two sources conflict, report the conflict instead of silently merging.
- Never claim ARK registration, seal, canon promotion, or supersedence without evidence.
